# Deep-link bridge (owner 2026-11-21). User-facing links use the PWA domain
# dropoff.carpsosolutions.store, but the token-consuming routes and the OS
# verification assets live on the API Worker. Proxy ONLY those paths so a tap
# works for both installed-app users and mobile browsers. Everything else is
# served by the Flutter PWA itself (including /r, /promo, /plans, /bookings).
/track/*	https://api.carpsosolutions.store/track/:splat	200
/t/*	https://api.carpsosolutions.store/t/:splat	200
/auth/*	https://api.carpsosolutions.store/auth/:splat	200
/.well-known/assetlinks.json	https://api.carpsosolutions.store/.well-known/assetlinks.json	200
/.well-known/apple-app-site-association	https://api.carpsosolutions.store/.well-known/apple-app-site-association	200
